-Imported associated notes retain original evidence/timestamps in `evidence/associated_notes.jsonl`.
+## Review 2026-10-07 — assignment `review-77585fe0f3de648e`
+
+The selected baseline (`generator.py` SHA-256
+`b3e9172eb5615cc86ba101ce76f6ca4b15a5bfb245c008bc0942764227cbc119`)
+modeled only a left-side blue blob reflected across a centered divider. It had no
+canonical rule-hash pin, rejected three of five canonical inputs, could not reach
+the canonical four-color palette, exposed dead/singleton axes, lacked a semantic
+contract, and had extensive unsound override behavior. The before battery ended
+5 green / 1 advisory / 6 failed; see
+`checks/before/checks/4f6f232c17bc_before_battery_summary.json`.
+
+The replacement constructive sampler (`VERSION = 3.0.0`, final generator SHA-256
+`357accbdabfa83ce3e48ca4d70a17108cd439eeb215bb554c37cf6abf4761b9b`)
+uses five exact controls and six scheduled semantic layouts. It supports blue
+objects on either side, centered and off-center axes, partial clipping,
+canonical-size anchors, a reflectable non-blue distractor, and an isolated extra
+gray cell. `self_check`, `strict_canonical_like`, exact override observation,
+seven executable rivals/witnesses, and a five-demo lesson contract are included.
+The Racket authority and canonical data were not changed.
+
+Task-local tests were written red-first. The final selected-task stage passes
+58 tests, including canonical parity, every exact override, invalid-input
+handling, all six layouts, rotation-safe lesson support, and the reusable
+`workspace/audit_distribution.py` probe. The complete after battery is 12/12
+green. A 100-lessons-per-band census materialized 300 production lessons and
+1,800 unique pairs; both production and all 1,800 query rotations had zero
+reported ambiguity against the declared finite rival set.
+
+No prior return was used as a defect lead: `evidence/associated_notes.jsonl` was
+empty. The retained passing task `b90d4c3d5553` was consulted only as a workflow
+and contract-shape example, not as a source of task-specific geometry.
+
+Known limitation: these finite declared-rival checks do not prove unique
+induction against every possible hypothesis. The deterministic six-profile cycle
+makes complete six-pair blocks semantically broad, but the shared census does not
+enumerate every conceivable curriculum assembly outside the production sampler.
